      "writtenOn": "2019-08-29T01:06:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So for our vendor-userspace clients that make use of the , will the usage have to be something like this?\n\n/* 5.x+ */\nif (ion_is_modern_version())\n    heap_id_mask \u003d ION_HEAP_SYSTEM;\n/* We do not intend on changing the UAPI in pre-5.x */\nelse\n    heap_id_mask \u003d ION_HEAP(SYSTEM_HEAP_ID);\n\nI suppose that it would have been good to keep some consistency in the way clients express their need to allocate from the system heap.",
