      "writtenOn": "2019-08-29T00:58:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t currently have any CMA heap usage in system image and neither do we have any carveout heap usage in system image.\n\nSo either these can be interpreted as some standard carveout and CMA heaps that Android might use in future and require all vendors to support or they could be removed if such provision isn\u0027t needed for now.",
