      "writtenOn": "2019-08-29T00:58:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So for vendor specific CMA and carveout heaps, they are expected to fall in this range? It will be nice for these to be able to use ION_HEAP_TYPE_DMA but the current ion.c implementation would imply that they would have to chose another custom type for it to work.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 69,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 69,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "f3843f14dea69dbe500b9783cff76a778c9f50dc",
